  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-11T09:00:39.846Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As Player object and it's Rigidbody are not exposed, it is impossible now to attach an arbitrary game object to Player using Joints. But having opportunity to do so may result in very interesting behavior in worlds.\nThis can be done theoretically by adding intermediate methods in the Player API, like: PlayerAPI.connectJointToPlayer(<joint>) or smth like that. In this case Player and their Rigididbody will not be exposed.",
